Package: krelboyneos-tools
Version: 0.1.5.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: grumpy-gaming <krelboyneos@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://krelboyneos.org
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, sudo
Recommends: ssl-cert, udisks2, upower, gnome-software, xfce4-genmon-plugin
Description: KrelboyneOS's own tools and update channel
 KOS Doctor (a checkup with a health overview and one-click fixes), KOS
 Software (optional tools and system updates), their helpers, the panel's
 network readout and the service that gives each install its own default
 SSL certificate.
 .
 Also adds the KrelboyneOS apt repository and its signing key, so these
 tools update with the rest of the system.
